-/// **A deliberately small PEM reader, written here rather than pulled in.**
-/// A CA bundle is a sequence of `-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----` / base64 /
-/// `-----END CERTIFICATE-----` blocks and nothing else. The alternative was a
